{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23580","headline":"郡中闲独寄微之及崔湖州 · 白居易","name":"郡中闲独寄微之及崔湖州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年宾旅非吾辈，晚岁簪缨束我身。\n酒散更无同宿客，诗成长作独吟人。\n苹洲会面知何日，镜水离心又一春。\n两处也应相忆在，官高年长少情亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}